# Response headers for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Cloudflare reads this file from the root of the build output; Astro copies
# everything in public/ there, which is why it lives here rather than beside
# the functions.
#
# The policy below is derived from what this site actually loads, checked
# against the source rather than against one build, because two of the things
# it has to allow are not in every build:
#
#   challenges.cloudflare.com  Turnstile. EstimateForm only emits the widget
#                              and its script when PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY
#                              is set, which it is not in a local build. A
#                              policy written from the built HTML would omit
#                              this and silently break the form's spam
#                              protection the day the key is added.
#   blob:                      ScrubHero fetches the film and hands the video
#                              element a Blob URL, so blob: is needed in
#                              media-src. Without it the hero shows its poster
#                              and nothing else, on every desktop visit.
#
# 'unsafe-inline' in script-src is a real weakening and is not there by
# laziness. Astro emits inline module and classic scripts on every page, and
# removing it needs either per-page hashes, which a static header file cannot
# track as pages change, or nonces, which need the HTML rewritten per request.
# What the directive still buys, even with inline allowed, is that script from
# any other origin is refused, which is the shape almost every injection takes.
# If this is ever tightened, do it with a nonce in functions/_middleware.ts and
# verify every page still runs before shipping it.
#
# frame-ancestors 'none' is the one that matters for a contractor: it stops the
# site being framed inside someone else's page and passed off as theirs, or
# used to trick a visitor into submitting the estimate form somewhere else.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob:; media-src 'self' blob:; frame-src https://maps.google.com https://www.google.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; connect-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
